WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.020
Need assistance?

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.857
Open Live Support and Tickets.

3
00:00:07.937 --> 00:00:12.389
Explain your problem, provide the required details and submit your support

4
00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:13.989
request.

5
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:17.603
Follow the available support process to receive assistance.

6
00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:20.114
Visit the Support page from the top menu.

7
00:00:20.194 --> 00:00:24.462
Choose your issue category—such as Resume Builder, Certificate Builder,

8
00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:28.810
Verification, Account Auth, or Bug Report—along with priority level and

9
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.410
channel.

10
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:34.758
Write a clear subject line and concise description, optionally attach a

11
00:00:34.838 --> 00:00:37.392
helpful screenshot, and submit your ticket.

12
00:00:37.472 --> 00:00:42.169
Every created ticket receives a structured reference number and status tracker

13
00:00:42.249 --> 00:00:46.884
so you can read staff replies, add follow-up messages, and resolve your issue

14
00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:48.722
smoothly from start to finish.

15
00:00:48.802 --> 00:00:50.322
Thank you for watching.
